sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User (Client)
    participant Flask as Flask Controller
    participant Pipe as Pipeline
    participant Mem as Memory (SQLite)
    participant Ret as Retriever
    participant Chroma as ChromaDB
    participant Gen as Generator (LLM)
    participant Eval as Evaluator
    participant TTS as TTS Engine

    Note over User, TTS: Scenario A: Successful Grounded Medical Query (Confidence >= 0.70)
    User->>Flask: 1. POST /api/query (query, session_id, voice=True)
    Flask->>Flask: 2. Check Sliding Window Rate Limit
    Flask->>Pipe: 3. handle_query(query, session_id, voice=True)
    Pipe->>Pipe: 4. Check concerning & creator pattern guards
    Pipe->>Mem: 5. get_history(session_id)
    Mem-->>Pipe: 6. Return conversation history
    Pipe->>Ret: 7. retrieve(query, top_k=4)
    Ret->>Ret: 8. Encode dense query embedding (MiniLM)
    Ret->>Chroma: 9. Query vector index with cosine similarity
    Chroma-->>Ret: 10. Return raw candidate passages
    Ret->>Ret: 11. Apply lexical rerank keyword boost
    Ret-->>Pipe: 12. Return ranked verified medical chunks
    Pipe->>Gen: 13. generate_answer(query, context, history)
    Gen->>Gen: 14. Query Groq Cloud LLaMA-3.3 (temp=0.1)
    Gen-->>Pipe: 15. Return draft synthesized clinical answer
    Pipe->>Eval: 16. evaluate_and_respond(query, context, draft)
    Eval->>Eval: 17. Evaluate Faithfulness & Relevance (Confidence >= 0.70)
    Eval-->>Pipe: 18. Return evaluated structured advisory
    Pipe->>Mem: 19. save_interaction(session_id, user, assistant, conf)
    Pipe->>TTS: 20. synthesize_speech(answer_text)
    TTS-->>Pipe: 21. Return audio stream URL
    Pipe-->>Flask: 22. Return final response dictionary
    Flask-->>User: 23. HTTP 200 OK (answer, citations, audio, confidence)

    Note over User, TTS: Scenario B: Ungrounded Query Refusal Path (Confidence < 0.60)
    User->>Flask: 24. POST /api/query (unsupported question)
    Flask->>Pipe: 25. handle_query(query, session_id)
    Pipe->>Ret: 26. retrieve(query, top_k=4)
    Ret-->>Pipe: 27. Return low-similarity context passages
    Pipe->>Gen: 28. generate_answer(query, low_context)
    Gen-->>Pipe: 29. Return weak draft answer
    Pipe->>Eval: 30. evaluate_and_respond(query, low_context, weak_draft)
    Eval->>Eval: 31. Evaluator flags low relevance/faithfulness (Score < 0.60)
    Eval-->>Pipe: 32. Return refusal advisory: "I don't have enough verified information..."
    Pipe->>Mem: 33. save_interaction(session_id, refusal_text, conf=0.0)
    Note over Pipe, TTS: TTS synthesis skipped due to refusal status
    Pipe-->>Flask: 34. Return refusal payload
    Flask-->>User: 35. HTTP 200 OK (refusal advisory, confidence=0.0, audio=None)
